{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/286fe1a1a08674d7dbc6e691cda87d5b.avif?t=1754587006\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Play as Capy and Corvi, a cute and curious duo, in the first demo for <strong>Capy Castaway</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Swallow Town, an overgrown island filled with quirky creatures and unusual treasures. Romp around and explore as you gather ingredients for the Spirit Word's first annual, but totally legendary, Great Swallow Town Cook-Off that EVERYONE knows about. Whether you\u2019re dropping mushrooms into the soup stump for that umami taste, or &quot;accidentally&quot; seasoning the soup with garbage, your choices shape the final flavour of your creation. It may even earn you the shiny, super coveted title of <strong>SOUP CHAMP</strong>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.poster.avif?t=1754587006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.webm?t=1754587006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/35c5fbafccddb2e403d215ac68a9a717.mp4?t=1754587006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visit Swallow Town\u00a0</strong>-\u00a0One of several whimsical areas Capy and Corvi will explore in Capy Castaway! Take in the architectural wonders, chat with the locals, and try to impress the judges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Great Swallow Town Cook-Off -\u00a0</strong>Don your chef\u2019s hat<strong> </strong>as you participate in this <i>totally legendary</i> competition and forage for weird and wonderful ingredients for your delicious or dubious soup.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Duo -</strong>\u00a0Capy can sniff and swim while Corvi flies ahead to fetch hard-to-reach items!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delightfully Silly -</strong>\u00a0Wear fruit as fashion, run through a mushroom fairy ring, or carry a stick just because it sparks joy. There\u2019s no wrong way to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/39378ff4acccac4b5b9e3d9901328b72.poster.avif?t=1754587006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/39378ff4acccac4b5b9e3d9901328b72.webm?t=1754587006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/39378ff4acccac4b5b9e3d9901328b72.mp4?t=1754587006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a peek into the full <strong>Capy Castaway</strong> experience: a heartfelt adventure about friendship and family in the aftermath of a natural disaster.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of cozy games and cute critters have been captivated by <strong>Capy Castaway</strong>, as it was recently featured in the Wholesome Direct 2025 showcase!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/1c8f4ac984b79532732d5e1eb9000927.avif?t=1754587006\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890490?t=1754587006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/fcc00be95829ac3e2288f5d22b6676a9336aba94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754587006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/02ec339be45a7bded84ef9784e19639c4986c9ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754587006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/02ec339be45a7bded84ef9784e19639c4986c9ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754587006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890490/extras/286fe1a1a08674d7dbc6e691cda87d5b.avif?t=1754587006\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Play as Capy and Corvi, a cute and curious duo, in the first demo for <strong>Capy Castaway</strong>.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Swallow Town, an overgrown island filled with quirky creatures and unusual treasures. Romp around and explore as you gather ingredients for the Spirit Word's first annual, but totally legendary, Great Swallow Town Cook-Off that EVERYONE knows about. Whether you\u2019re dropping mushrooms into the soup stump for that umami taste, or &quot;accidentally&quot; seasoning the soup with garbage, your choices shape the final flavour of your creation. It may even earn you the shiny, super coveted title of <strong>SOUP CHAMP</strong>!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\